WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.524
Unit fourteen. Smoking Harms Health!

2
00:00:04.475 --> 00:00:08.087
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.137 --> 00:00:11.946
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.996 --> 00:00:16.117
Today we learn about Smoking Harms Health. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.945 --> 00:00:20.729
Tobacco. Say it with me. Tobacco!

6
00:00:24.236 --> 00:00:27.886
Smoking. Say it with me. Smoking!

7
00:00:31.369 --> 00:00:35.269
Nicotine. Say it with me. Nicotine!

8
00:00:38.769 --> 00:00:42.236
Lungs. Say it with me. Lungs!

9
00:00:45.738 --> 00:00:49.321
Addiction. Say it with me. Addiction!

10
00:00:52.836 --> 00:00:57.236
Secondhand smoke. Say it with me. Secondhand smoke!

11
00:01:00.736 --> 00:01:04.286
Cancer. Say it with me. Cancer!

12
00:01:07.798 --> 00:01:11.498
Refuse. Say it with me. Refuse!

13
00:01:15.001 --> 00:01:24.947
Tobacco contains nicotine, which causes addiction. Smoking damages the lungs and can cause cancer. Secondhand smoke harms people nearby, so I refuse to smoke.

14
00:01:24.997 --> 00:01:26.278
I can do that too!

15
00:01:27.558 --> 00:01:32.802
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:32.852 --> 00:01:34.002
Nicotine!

17
00:01:35.146 --> 00:01:40.341
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:40.391 --> 00:01:41.541
Cancer!

19
00:01:42.511 --> 00:01:47.255
Did you know? There is no safe amount of secondhand smoke!

20
00:01:47.305 --> 00:01:49.417
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:50.108 --> 00:01:57.781
Think and answer. How does secondhand smoke harm others?

22
00:01:57.831 --> 00:01:58.981
Great answer!

23
00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:05.114
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:05.164 --> 00:02:07.838
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

